<div class="modal fade"
     id="hint1"
     tabindex="-1"
     aria-labelledby="hintLabel"
     aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold"
            id="hintLabel">操作提示</h5>
        <button type="button"
                class="btn-close"
                data-bs-dismiss="modal"
                aria-label="關閉"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        {{>common-notes01}}

        <p>
          <button class="btn btn-primary"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#ifo-search"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="ifo-search">
            銷售資料 查詢 ▼
          </button>
        </p>
        <div class="collapse mb-3"
             id="ifo-search">
          <div class="card card-body">
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">1</span> 輸入查詢條件</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">2</span> 按下「Enter」或藍色「查詢」鍵，可進行資料篩選與查詢</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-info text-black">注意</span> 查詢資料區間越長，花費時間越久</p>

            <p class="text-danger fs-5 fw-bold mb-1 mt-4">查詢欄位說明:</p>
            <ol class="list-group list-group-flush list-group-numbered">
              <li class="list-group-item">日期範圍：無輸入，預設只查當日資料</li>
              <li class="list-group-item">多選欄位：無選擇，預設查全部資料</li>
            </ol>

            <p class="text-danger fs-5 fw-bold mb-1 mt-3">金額欄位說明:</p>
            <ol class="list-group list-group-flush list-group-numbered">
              <li class="list-group-item">售價：商品售出價格</li>
              <li class="list-group-item">加值：會顯示加值名稱，如：保養廠、機車行</li>
              <li class="list-group-item">小計：售價 × 數量</li>
              <li class="list-group-item">品項折讓：單品項的總折價金額 (招待贈送)</li>
              <li class="list-group-item">整單折讓：整單折價金額 (特殊折扣)：打折會以 (小計加總+品項折讓加總) 做計算</li>
              <li class="list-group-item">總金額：小計加總 + 品項折讓加總 + 整單折讓</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          <button class="btn btn-success"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#ifo-exportToExcel"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="ifo-exportToExcel">
            匯出 EXCEL ▼
          </button>
        </p>
        <div class="collapse mb-3"
             id="ifo-exportToExcel">
          <div class="card card-body">
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">1</span> 先執行 <span class="fs-6 badge bg-primary py-2"> 查詢 </span>
            </p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">2</span> 按下「Enter」或藍色「查詢」鍵，可進行資料篩選與查詢</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-info text-black">注意</span> 匯出資料越多，花費時間越久</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        {{>common-notes02}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>